# Read Me stays current

When a Gym Manager feature is added or its behaviour changes, update `frontend/src/features/readme/readme-guide.ts` in the same change.

- Add or edit the topic that matches the menu (Dashboard, Members, Settings, Analytics, and so on).
- Say what it does and how to use it, in plain language.
- Do not describe a write to members, payments, portal auth, WhatsApp, or audit logs unless that write is the feature.
- The page is display-only. Do not add save buttons to Read Me.
